From 645f146fb14636c42867e6ec83398ebcf1fdfeef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:30:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Menus with no player inventory and no slots

A menu type's screen takes "hide_inventory": true: the player's 36
inventory slots are not drawn or offered on the client and are hidden on
the server (no click, no shift-click target), the panel is width by height,
the Inventory label goes. "slots": 0 is accepted for menus of buttons and
text alone; item and entity menus with 0 slots tick and press as others,
items empty. Example item-menu-demo gains imenu:reader.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
